From e4aab22d306fb3de24ff71ca45fb0e2c225dd164 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Or Magen <ormagen@amazon.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Jan 2026 16:33:57 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/5] fix: Complete pahole parser implementation with edge case
 handling

- Fix double-escaped regex patterns (was matching nothing)
- Handle complex types with spaces (class vector<...>)
- Handle multi-word types (class line_reference, unsigned int)
- Handle inheritance (class Derived : public Base)
- Handle typedef structs (struct typedef Name Name)
- Handle arrays (member[4])
- Skip vtable pointers (_vptr)
- Skip built-in types with line 0

Results:
- 14/15 edge case tests pass (93%)
- Real-world: 202/228 structs extracted (89% - 25 duplicates removed)
- al_report: 20/21 members found (only vtable missing - correct)
- Performance: 0.4s per file, ~6 min for 6822 files
